{"id":"vod_sn_37700","vodId":"37700","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"青之驱魔师","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0b68e5fdd5974efe349fe018894f5d06.jpg"},"summary":"奥村磷（冈本信彦 配音）自幼被神父藤本狮郎（藤原启治 配音）收养，某一日，磷发现了自己其实是撒旦之子的秘密，之后养父的惨死让磷下定居心走上了驱魔师的道路。磷所存在的世界被分为“物质界”和“虚无界”两大空间，人类生存于物质界，在虚无界中，则徘徊着凶残暴戾的魔鬼。　　身边接连发生的伤害事件让磷逐渐发现，某些虚无界的恶魔，趁虚而入潜入了人类世界。为了伸张正义保护同类，磷果断的担负起了驱魔的职责。在弟弟奥村雪男（福山润 配音）的帮助下，磷不断的向着真相前进，此时的磷也发现，造成这一切混乱的元凶，可能就藏在他们的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/L9VPduKPLv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/F4PP38acig1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XQk0x0SV9K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EGTu7Jgm6C1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/C8ji5Mdg4X1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/0XwsiNuhNy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EZJM59Lmvw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yRR8BUqqd01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1QKSXQXM8j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/FyRMiRbbDA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gH5fH91qZ41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uMRQem9Axn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eS3PGgRyet1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CWm340bkY71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/